        <obo:IAO_0000115>Pain experienced as an intense, sudden, and sharp sensation, often described as a knife-like or shooting pain that pierces a specific body area.</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <obo:IAO_0000589>stabbing pain (PAIN)</obo:IAO_0000589>
        <terms:contributor rdf:resource="http://orcid.org/0000-0001-9625-1899"/>
